  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 302.04 “Administration” means the road toll administration of the New Hampshire department of safety. The term includes “road toll administration”.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; renumbered by #10753 (formerly Saf-C 302.02); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (See Revision Note #3 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300)",
